[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4441.189, "timestamp": "01:14:01", "text": "去看看原子中的组成部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4443.59, "timestamp": "01:14:03", "text": "设计。让我们开始吧。我们来看一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4445.27, "timestamp": "01:14:05", "text": "简单组件。由此我们也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4447.59, "timestamp": "01:14:07", "text": "先了解一下什么是组件。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4449.27, "timestamp": "01:14:09", "text": "这张客户评价卡上写着："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4450.95, "timestamp": "01:14:10", "text": "一张图片，一些文字，然后是一个赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4452.39, "timestamp": "01:14:12", "text": "按钮。现在，假设我想使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4454.07, "timestamp": "01:14:14", "text": "这在我的设计中经常出现。我只能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4455.51, "timestamp": "01:14:15", "text": "重复多次，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4456.79, "timestamp": "01:14:16", "text": "如果我想改变某些东西，比如说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4458.63, "timestamp": "01:14:18", "text": "我希望这张图片现在出现在这里，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4459.83, "timestamp": "01:14:19", "text": "必须进去对每个都这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4462.07, "timestamp": "01:14:22", "text": "一个。但是有了组件，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4463.75, "timestamp": "01:14:23", "text": "只需要更换主要部件即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4466.07, "timestamp": "01:14:26", "text": "以及它的每一次重复或实例"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4467.669, "timestamp": "01:14:27", "text": "将自动更改。我要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4469.669, "timestamp": "01:14:29", "text": "选择我的推荐卡，然后在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4471.27, "timestamp": "01:14:31", "text": "在设计面板的顶部，您将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4473.27, "timestamp": "01:14:33", "text": "拥有这四颗钻石。如果我点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4475.43, "timestamp": "01:14:35", "text": "对于它们，我现在已经创建了一个组件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4477.11, "timestamp": "01:14:37", "text": "你会注意到它有紫色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4478.709, "timestamp": "01:14:38", "text": "围绕它设置一个边界框。你会看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4480.63, "timestamp": "01:14:40", "text": "在图层面板中也有这个选项。话题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4482.87, "timestamp": "01:14:42", "text": "为你。任何紫色的东西都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4485.03, "timestamp": "01:14:45", "text": "组件或组件实例"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4487.03, "timestamp": "01:14:47", "text": "或其副本。所以现在就是这样了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4488.79, "timestamp": "01:14:48", "text": "它是一个组件，它也存在于我的内部。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4490.47, "timestamp": "01:14:50", "text": "资产面板。所以如果我进去这里，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4492.31, "timestamp": "01:14:52", "text": "你会看到它就在那里，而且它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4494.149, "timestamp": "01:14:54", "text": "创建于此文件中。现在我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4495.99, "timestamp": "01:14:55", "text": "创建此组件的一个实例。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4498.229, "timestamp": "01:14:58", "text": "有三种方法可以做到这一点。我可以拖到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4499.669, "timestamp": "01:14:59", "text": "使用我的资产创建实例"}]